Template Source

Templates must be synchronized from Meta.

Users cannot create templates directly from the application.

Template creation is handled in Meta Business Manager.

Application only supports:

Sync Template
Preview Template
Use Template
Required Database

templates
campaigns
campaign_contacts

Required APIs

GET /api/v1/templates

POST /api/v1/templates/sync

GET /api/v1/campaigns

POST /api/v1/campaigns

POST /api/v1/campaigns//send

GET /api/v1/campaigns//report

Campaign Flow

Create Campaign
→ Select WABA
→ Select Template
→ Configure Variables
→ Select Audience
→ Schedule
→ Send

Variable Mapping

Template variables must support mapping from contact fields.

Example:

{{1}} → contact.name

{{2}} → contact.order_number

Sending Rules

Campaign sending must be asynchronous.

Required flow:

Campaign
→ Queue
→ Worker
→ Meta API

Direct synchronous sending from API is prohibited.

